  "bio": "Discover the masterful artistry of black & gray tattoos at Kings of Ink Hengelo, where bold creativity meets precision in a stylish, welcoming studio. Nestled in the heart of Hengelo, Netherlands, at Marktstraat 4, this premier tattoo and piercing destination promises an exceptional experience for every client who walks through its doors. Follow their journey and portfolio on www.facebook.com/kingsofinkhengelo and join the ranks of the inked royalty.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Hengelo, Overijssel, Netherlands"
